<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 26: </span>Task-model prompt templates for multiple-choice answering. Note that <span id="A2.F26.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">reasoning_instructions</span> are described in <a href="#A2.F27" title="In Appendix B Additional Experiment Details ‣ Counterfactual Simulation Training for Chain-of-Thought Faithfulness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">27</span></a>, where the default is “Make sure your reasoning supports your final answer choice.”</figcaption>
</figure>
